1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,807
The setting: a dining room in French Switzerland in the eighteen eighties, with a view of Lake Léman over the cypress trees of a churchyard, so death is in the view from the start.

2
00:00:10,807 --> 00:00:20,351
Monsieur Durand keeps a boarding house for tourists, and it is failing: one tourist in two months, since the railway went east instead.

3
00:00:20,351 --> 00:00:21,861
Debts are everywhere.

4
00:00:21,861 --> 00:00:27,005
But, he tells his eldest daughter Adèle, he has paid the fire insurance.

5
00:00:27,005 --> 00:00:28,098
Remember that.

